<decision #effective-vfs-before-halfcode-projection apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" blocks = [] durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1H69VR71QAKDMFCRN3H1FSR>
  程序内嵌资源与 home/workspace `.eidolon` 的覆盖，应在 Halfcode Registry 层按 FQN 组合，还是先通过 path overlay 与 mutation 物化为唯一最终 VFS？
  </?01M1H69VR71QAKDMFCRN3H1FSR>
  <recommendation ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8N>
  采用 Effective-VFS-first：BunFS 持有版本化 base，`.eidolon` 表达路径 replacement 和 identity-aware mutation，原子产生唯一 `/.eidolon` 最终态；Halfcode 只从该最终态做单向语义投影。
  </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8N>
  <options [
    <option { key = "A" recommended = true } (
      <title ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8P>
      先物化 Effective VFS，再编译 Halfcode 资源
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8P>
      <description ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Q>
      以路径、VFS node identity 与 XNL `#id` 表达 overlay，完整支持 replace/add/delete/move/rename、结构 mutation、diff/rebase、revision 与原子失败；所有 consumer 只读取最终 VFS。
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Q>
      <tradeoff ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8R>
      需要跨 XNL VFS、Halfcode compiler 与 Eidolon 重构现有物理 rootDir 和 registry layer 依赖，并迁移历史 receipt。
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8R>
    )>
    <option { key = "B" recommended = false } (
      <title ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8S>
      继续在 Halfcode Registry 中按 FQN 叠加资源层
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8S>
      <description ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8T>
      分别加载 builtin/global/workspace ResourceTree，并让较高层相同 FQN 获胜。
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8T>
      <tradeoff ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8V>
      无法自然表达 `.eidolon` 最终文件视图、跨路径 move/rename、文件删除与 XNL mutation；Registry 与 VFS 会形成两个 overlay authority。
      </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8V>
    )>
  ]>
  <answer (
    <raw-answer ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8W>
    VFS 映射到 `.eidolon` 的原始设计参考 Kubernetes overlay：放入 VFS 的就是最终生效版本；进入 VFS 前可以叠加 overlay，或者基于过往版本通过 XNL mutation/diff/apply 做扩展。
    </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8W>
    <decision-text ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8X>
    Eidolon SHALL build one revisioned Effective VFS at logical root `/.eidolon` from an immutable BunFS base followed by explicit home and workspace overlays. Path replacement and VFS/XNL mutations SHALL be applied and validated before publication. Runtime configuration, Halfcode, Agent and Workflow consumers SHALL read only the admitted Effective VFS. Halfcode FQN SHALL remain a post-materialization semantic identity and MUST NOT become a parallel overlay authority.
    </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8X>
    <rationale ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Y>
    该结构保持 base 对 overlay 无感、overlay 可复用、build 结果独立的 Kustomize 思想，并直接复用 XNL 的 path、stable identity、diff、strict dry-run mutation、VFS mutation、snapshot 与 revision/CAS 能力。它同时消除内嵌默认值、物理 `.eidolon` 与 effective registry 各自裁决当前资源的风险。
    </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Y>
    <evidence ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Z>
    用户于 2026-08-31 明确修正；Eidolon `symbiont-contract/logic` ResourceVFS 的 `/.eidolon` 路径约定；XNL core/VFS mutation、diff/apply、revisioned persistence 与 snapshot tests；Halfcode CLI lite BunFS ResourceEffect/build；Halfcode compiler rootDir loader；Eidolon resource registry global/workspace layer actual state。
    </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH8Z>
  )>
  <confidence ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH90>
  high
  </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH90>
  <reversibility ?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH91>
  hard
  </?01M1H69VR8CFHESXX7RQVEEH91>
)>
